{"nerai":"","spec":"<div id=\"post\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">\n        \n        <h1 class=\"setting\">設定狙い：設定判別</h1>\n       \n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">まずはココを見ろ！</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h5>①</h5>\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">設定判別項目</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>確定演出</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2023-12-21\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">AT終了画面</td>\n                            <td>★★★★☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2023-12-21\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">二虎流奥義伝授 極突入時の扉絵</td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2023-12-21\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">エンディング中のボイスとランプ</td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                \n\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <p class=\"js-menu\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-01-09\" loading=\"lazy\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-01-09\">2024/01/09更新</div>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p>差枚大幅マイナスの場合は2時間半前のAT後やめ</p>\n                    <p>差枚0枚ライン付近の場合は2時間前のAT後やめ</p>\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>★★★☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n                <p>上位CZを有利区間切れで突破すると、純増5枚のATへと移行するのが本機の特徴です。</p>\n                <p>差枚のマイナスが大きくエンディングまで遠い台は純増も実質下がってしまうため、早めの見切りをおすすめします。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>CZ・AT確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                